{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18468","headline":"东风二章 二 · 欧阳詹","name":"东风二章 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东风叶时，匪凿匪[穮]。\n莫蛰在泉，莫枯在条。\n宵不徯晨乃繇，东风之行地上兮。\n上德爲政，匪食匪招。\n莫顾於家，莫流於辽。\n以饱以回，晨不徯霄，陇西公来浚都兮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18468.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18468","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}